{"1625830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brendan Keogh's Putting Challenge", "steam_appid": 1625830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [1842120, 1888190], "detailed_description": "<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625830/extras/264bd27ebfd53ff01bc12049bb61aab1.avif?t=1785923863\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brendan Keogh's Putting Challenge: Championship Edition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Championship Edition</strong> is a discounted bundle that includes the base game of Brendan Keogh's Putting Challenge + The Luxury Golf Cart + OST</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong><i>Brendan Keogh’s Putting Challenge</i></strong> is a relaxing open-world golf game about all the parts other golf videogames cut out. Sounds tedious? It sort of is. <br><br>With up to four players on a single device (or online by using Remote Play), you have complete freedom to explore the massive open-world at your own pace with your friends. Play a round of mini-golf, compete on a full 9 hole course, go for a bike ride or just see who can hit the ball the furthest at the driving range. It’s entirely up to you.<br><br>Originally developed in Pico-8, this labour of love has been painstakingly rebuilt and expanded on to include a larger world and more features, while retaining the original 8-bit retro charm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625830/extras/196c1f844d1eda69acb9167c5c31f246.avif?t=1785923863\" width=600 height=126 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Massive open-world to explore<br></li><li> Five 9-hole courses including; mini-golf, an extra-large desert course, and secret holes hidden throughout the world<br></li><li> Up to four players local (or online by using Remote Play)<br></li><li> Full controller support<br></li><li> Two players are able to play using a single keyboard<br></li><li> Save your progress for later<br></li><li> Original soundtrack by Dan Golding (Untitled Goose Game, Frog Detective)<br></li><li> 22 Achievements</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brendan Keogh's Putting Challenge: Luxury Golf Cart</h2>Walking to each hole feeling a bit tedious? Good, it's meant to. But! Why not travel in style with your very own 4-seater luxury golf cart! <br>Ride around with 3 of your other friends, or not. It's your cart so do what you want with it. <i>(except drive it outside of the golf courses, which is strictly prohibited)</i>", "about_the_game": "<strong><i>Brendan Keogh’s Putting Challenge</i></strong> is a relaxing open-world golf game about all the parts other golf videogames cut out. Sounds tedious? It sort of is. <br><br>With up to four players on a single device (or online by using Remote Play), you have complete freedom to explore the massive open-world at your own pace with your friends. Play a round of mini-golf, compete on a full 9 hole course, go for a bike ride or just see who can hit the ball the furthest at the driving range. It’s entirely up to you.<br><br>Originally developed in Pico-8, this labour of love has been painstakingly rebuilt and expanded on to include a larger world and more features, while retaining the original 8-bit retro charm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625830/extras/196c1f844d1eda69acb9167c5c31f246.avif?t=1785923863\" width=600 height=126 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Massive open-world to explore<br></li><li> Five 9-hole courses including; mini-golf, an extra-large desert course, and secret holes hidden throughout the world<br></li><li> Up 